exports[`generatePackage > matches the snapshot (desktop-first) > desktop-first: README.md 1`] = `
"# Acme Health CSS package

Generated by AuthorKit from the “Spring launch” project.

- **Class prefix:** \`acme\`
- **Responsive approach:** desktop-first
- **Files:** 8 stylesheets plus \`acme-health.css\`

> Do not edit these files by hand. Change the project in AuthorKit and regenerate,
> so the CSS, the style guide and this README stay in sync.

## Quick start

\`\`\`html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="acme-health.css">
\`\`\`

\`acme-health.css\` imports every stylesheet in the right order. To load the files yourself
(for example in an AEM clientlib), keep this order:

1. \`css/tokens.css\`: Design tokens
2. \`css/global.css\`: Global (type, links, base)
3. \`css/components/cta.css\`: CTA buttons
4. \`css/components/accordion.css\`: Accordion
5. \`css/components/header.css\`: Header
6. \`css/components/footer.css\`: Footer
7. \`css/components/isi.css\`: ISI and safety bar
8. \`css/components/modals.css\`: Modals

## Folder structure

\`\`\`
acme-health/
├── acme-health.css  ← entry: imports every stylesheet
├── README.md  ← this file
└── css/
    ├── tokens.css  ← tokens
    ├── global.css  ← global
    └── components/
        ├── header.css  ← header
        ├── footer.css  ← footer
        ├── isi.css  ← isi
        ├── modals.css  ← modals
        ├── cta.css  ← cta
        └── accordion.css  ← accordion
\`\`\`

## Breakpoints

| Name | Screen width | Media query |
| --- | --- | --- |
| desktop | ≥ 1024px | base styles (no media query) |
| tablet | 768px – 1023px | \`@media (max-width: 1023px)\` |
| mobile | ≤ 767px | \`@media (max-width: 767px)\` |

Desktop-first: base styles target the largest screen. Each \`max-width\` query adds changes for smaller screens.
Look for \`/* @authorkit-responsive … */\` comments in each file to find the overrides for a breakpoint.

## Naming

Every class uses BEM with the \`acme-\` prefix, so these styles cannot collide with other CSS on the page:

- Block: \`.acme-btn\`
- Element: \`.acme-btn__icon\`
- Modifier: \`.acme-btn--primary\`
- Custom property (token): \`--acme-color-primary\`

\`global.css\` also styles plain HTML elements (\`h1\`–\`h6\`, \`p\`, \`a\`, \`sup\`, \`sub\`, lists and images),
so rich text from authors is styled without extra classes.

## Customising

All design values are CSS custom properties. Override a token after loading the package:

\`\`\`css
:root {
  --acme-color-primary: #0b4f8a;
}
\`\`\`

## Components

| File | Component | Classes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`css/global.css\` | Global (type, links, base) | \`.acme-h1\` \`.acme-h2\` \`.acme-h3\` \`.acme-h4\` \`.acme-h5\` \`.acme-h6\` |
| \`css/components/header.css\` | Header | \`.acme-header\` \`.acme-header--sticky\` \`.acme-header__inner\` \`.acme-header__logo\` \`.acme-header__toggle\` \`.acme-header__nav\` \`.acme-header__list\` \`.acme-header__link\` |
| \`css/components/footer.css\` | Footer | \`.acme-footer\` \`.acme-footer__inner\` \`.acme-footer__logo\` \`.acme-footer__links\` \`.acme-footer__link\` \`.acme-footer__legal\` \`.acme-footer__copyright\` |
| \`css/components/isi.css\` | ISI and safety bar | \`.acme-isi\` \`.acme-isi__content\` \`.acme-isi__title\` \`.acme-isi__section\` \`.acme-isi-bar\` \`.acme-isi-bar--expanded\` \`.acme-isi-bar__header\` \`.acme-isi-bar__title\` \`.acme-isi-bar__toggle\` \`.acme-isi-bar__icon\` \`.acme-isi-bar__content\` \`.acme-isi-bar-spacer\` |
| \`css/components/modals.css\` | Modals | \`.acme-modal\` \`.acme-modal--interstitial\` \`.acme-modal__header\` \`.acme-modal__title\` \`.acme-modal__close\` \`.acme-modal__body\` \`.acme-modal__footer\` \`.acme-modal-open\` |
| \`css/components/cta.css\` | CTA buttons | \`.acme-btn\` \`.acme-btn--primary\` \`.acme-btn--secondary\` \`.acme-btn--tertiary\` \`.acme-btn--block\` \`.acme-btn__icon\` |
| \`css/components/accordion.css\` | Accordion | \`.acme-accordion\` \`.acme-accordion__item\` \`.acme-accordion__heading\` \`.acme-accordion__trigger\` \`.acme-accordion__icon\` \`.acme-accordion__panel\` |
"
`;

